  "prefLabel": "En 1501.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1501.02 Applicability. En 1500 shall apply to:\n\n(a) Public utilities within the meaning of RSA 362:2;\n\n(b) Rural electric cooperatives for which a certificate of deregulation is on file pursuant to RSA 301:57;\n\n(c) Municipal corporations and county corporations regardless of whether operating within their corporate limits; and\n\n(d) Every other corporation or other entity, and every individual desiring to cross any public water or land for any purpose set forth in RSA 371:17.\n\nSource. #13939, eff 4-26-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1500.html"
}
